NOTICE for magpie-digital-pet-portal
====================================

This package is an unofficial, third-party static showcase page for the
Digital Pet plugin. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or maintained by
any official community organization or the magpie maintainers. It contains no
gateway middleware, no provider registration, and no runtime engine.

The page is a single static HTML/CSS/JS document. It does not start a service,
does not read or write pet saves, and does not process agent requests.

Selected pixel scene backgrounds and sprite frames are redistributed here for
